ility with its printed stats. || NOT STORED: the Captain Sampson Rhees NPC stat line, size 4 feet to 4 feet 6 inches, weight 120-200 pounds, life span 6D6+120 years, the names Pirate Dwarves and Mystic Dwarves, slave market value, habitat, allies and enemies; in GM Notes."
